        {
          "path": "_m/c/b/n/x/st-croix-river-wisconsin-minnesota-wp/quartzose-sandstones-mazomanie.jpg",
          "filename": "Quartzose sandstones (Mazomanie Formation, Upper Cambrian; riverside cliff, western side of the St. Croix River, northeast of Lookout Point, Minnesota, USA) 4 (18811819890).jpg",
          "caption": "Quartzose sandstones in the Cambrian of Minnesota, USA.\nThis cliff exposure consists of quartzose sandstones of the Mazomanie Formation, a shallow marine siliciclastic succession in the Upper Cambrian of the Upper Mississippi Valley, USA.  Herringbone cross-bedding and trough cross-bedding are moderately common here.  Skolithos trace fossils and intraclastic sandstone horizons are also present.\nStratigraphy: Mazomanie Formation, upper Tunnel City Group (formerly the Franconia Sandstone), Sunwaptan Stage, Upper Cambrian, ~491-493 Ma\n\nLocality: riverside cliff exposures along the western side of St. Croix River, below a rest stop along Rt. 95 between mileposts 101 and 102, just northeast of Lookout Point, north-northeast of the town of Stillwater, Minnesota, USA (45° 05’ 03.80\" North, 92° 47’ 10.33\" West)",
          "alt": "Quartzose sandstones in the Cambrian of Minnesota, USA.\nThis cliff exposure consists of quartzose sandstones of the Mazomanie Formation, a shallow marine siliciclastic succession in the Upper Cambrian of the Upper Mississippi Valley, USA.  Herringbone cross-bedding and trough cross-bedding are moderately common here.  Skolithos trace fossils and intraclastic sandstone horizons are also present.\nStratigraphy: Mazomanie Formation, upper Tunnel City Group (formerly the Franconia Sandstone), Sunwaptan Stage, Upper Cambrian, ~491-493 Ma\n\nLocality: riverside cliff exposures along the western side of St. Croix River, below a rest stop along Rt. 95 between mileposts 101 and 102, just northeast of Lookout Point, north-northeast of the town of Stillwater, Minnesota, USA (45° 05’ 03.80\" North, 92° 47’ 10.33\" West)",
          "width": 3000,
          "height": 4000,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "James St. John",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Quartzose_sandstones_(Mazomanie_Formation,_Upper_Cambrian;_riverside_cliff,_western_side_of_the_St._Croix_River,_northeast_of_Lookout_Point,_Minnesota,_USA)_4_(18811819890).jpg",
